@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@apiPrefix = /v1
@accessToken = your_access_token_here
@adminToken = your_admin_token_here
@userId = your_user_id_here

### Get My Wallet (balance + transaction history)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wallet?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get My Wallet - Page 2
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/wallet?page=2&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### ─── ADMIN ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Admin Credit Wallet (reward a user)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/wallet/credit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 500,
  "reason": "Welcome bonus"
}

### Admin Credit Wallet - Referral Reward
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/admin/wallet/credit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "amount": 250,
  "reason": "Referral reward"
}
